<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">James</book>
  <para style="h">James</para>
  <para style="toc1">James</para>
  <para style="toc2">James</para>
  <para style="mt">James</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakoba, Pathian leh Lalpa Isua Krista bâwih chuan Hnam Sâwm leh Hnam Hnih Darhte chu chibai a bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka unaute u, in rinna fiahna chuan chhelna a siam tih hriain, thlêmna tinrêng in tawh hunin lâwmna hlîrah ngai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, eng mah tlachham lova in famkima, in puma in him theih nân chhelna chuan thawk famkim rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In zîngah tu pawhin finna a tlâkchham chuan, mi zawng zawng hnêna hau lo leh ui lova pe ṭhîntu Pathian chu dîl rawh se; chutichuan, a hnênah pêk a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, ringhlel hauh lovin, rinna neiin dîl rawh se; ringhleltu chu tuifinriat fâwn, thli chhêm lên leh vawrh ang a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutiang mi, rilru bulbâl nei lo, a thiltih zawng zawnga nghet lo mi chuan Lalpa hnênah eng mah hmuh inring suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Unau daikil kâra mi chu chawimawia a awm avângin lâwm rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hausa erawh chu tihtlâwma a awm avângin lâwm rawh se; hlobet pâr angin a la ral mai dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni a lo chhuaha, thli lum tak a lo tlehin hlobet a tivuai a; tin, a pâr chu a rêm a, a awm dân mawizia chu a boral ṭhîn; chutiang bawkin mi hausa chu a kalnaah chuan a lo vuai dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thlêmna tuar hrâm hrâmtu chu a eng a thâwl e; fiaha a awm hnuin nunna lallukhum, Lalpan amah hmangaihtute hnêna a tiam chu a hmu dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu mân thlêmna an tawh laiin, “Pathian thlêm ka ni,” ti suh se; Pathian chu sual thlêm rual a ni lo, amah pawhin tu mah a thlêm ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi tin mahni châknaa hruai bo leh hîpa an awm chuan thlêmna an tâwk a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, châkna chuan no a pai a, sual a hring ṭhîn a; tin, sual chuan a lo puitlinin thihna a hring ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka unau duh takte u, bumin awm suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thilpêk ṭha leh thilpêk famkim zawng zawng chu, chung lam aṭangin êngte Pa hnên ata a lo chhuk ṭhîn a ni, amahah chuan danglamna leh herna hlim rêng rêng a awm thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thilsiamte hmahruaitu ang kan lo nih theih nân, ama duh zâwngin thutak lakah chuan min hring a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Unau duh takte u, chûng chu in hria e; nimahsela, mi tinin ngaihthlâk chuh sela, thusawi chuh lo sela, thin tinel rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />mihring thinurnain Pathian felna chu a siam si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuvângin, bawlhhlawh zawng zawng leh sual khat liam chu dah bo ula, thu tuh, in thlarau chhandam thei chu, thuhnuairawlh takin pawm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, thu ngaithlatute mai ni lovin, zâwmtute lo ni zâwk rawh u; chuti lo chu, mahni inbum in lo ni dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu pawh thu ngaithlatu nia zâwmtu ni si lo chu, mi, dârthlalanga a pianpui hmai ngun taka inen ang chu a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ngun takin a inen a, a kal bo va, mi eng ang nge a nih a intheihnghilh nghâl si ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, tu pawh dân famkim, zalênna dân hi biha, chutianga awm renga, ngaithlaa, theihnghilh leh mai ṭhîntu ni lova, zâwma, hna thawk fo ṭhîntu ni zâwk chu, chu mi chu a thiltihah malsâwmin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu pawh sakhaw ngaihsak nia inringa, a lei vêng ṭha si lova, mahni thinlung inbum zâwk chu, chu mi sakhaw biak dân chu eng mah a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kan Pathian leh Pa mit hmuha sakhaw biak dân thianghlim leh sual tel lo chu hei hi a ni, fahrah leh hmeithaite an hrehawm laia kan leh, khawvêl bawlhhlawh kai lova insiam ṭhin hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka unaute u, kan Lalpa Isua Krista, Ropuina Lalpa chu ring chungin, mi thlei bîk nei suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In inkhâwmna inah mi, rangkachak zungbun bun, puan mawi tak sin lo lût sela, tin, mi rethei puan chhe tak sin lo lût bawk sela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tin, puan mawi tak sin chu in ngaihsaka, a hnênah chuan, “Nang, he hmun ṭhaah hian ṭhu rawh,” in tiha, mi rethei hnênah chuan, “Nang chu sawtah sâwn ding la, a nih loh leh ka ke nghahchhan hrûlah hian ṭhu rawh,” in tih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />in rilruah thlei bîk neiin ngaihtuahna sual pua sawisêltute in lo ni dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka unau duh takte u, ngai teh u, Pathianin he khawvêl thila retheite hi rinnaa hausa tûr leh, amah hmangaihtute hnêna a tiam ram chu luahtu tûrahte a ruat lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangni zawngin mi rethei chu in timualpho ta zâwk a ni. Mi hausate chu a tiduhdahtu che u leh rorêlna ina hnûk lût ṭhîntu che u chu an ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hming zahawm tak in put hi sawichhetute chu an ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela Pathian Lehkha Thu, “Nangmah i inhmangaih angin i vêngte i hmangaih tûr a ni,” tih lal dân hi in zawm chuan in tiṭha e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />amaherawhchu, mi thlei bîk in neih chuan in tisual a ni, Dânin bawhchhetuah a chantîr si che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu pawhin Dân zâwm kim mah sela, kawng khata a tihsual si chuan, a zaah chuan thiam loh changin a awm tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Uire suh,” titu chuan, “Tual that suh,” a ti bawk si a. Chutichuan, uire lo mah la, tual i thah si chuan Dân bawhchhetu i ni rêng rêng tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, zalênna dâna rorêlsak turate angin thu sawi ula, thil ti bawk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi chunga khawngaihna nei lo chu khawngaihna tel lovin rorêlsakin a awm ang; khawngaihna hi rorêlna aiin a chungnung zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka unaute u, miin, “Rinna ka nei,” ti mah sela, thiltih a neih si loh chuan eng nge sâwt ang? Chutiang rinna chuan amah a chhandam thei ang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Unaupa emaw, unaunu emaw, saruaka awmin an ni tin chaw tlachham sela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tin, in zînga tuin emaw an hnênah, “Thlamuang takin kal ula, lum tak leh puar takin awm rawh u,” ti ula, taksa tâna thil châkkhai chu in pêk si loh chuan eng nge sâwt ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin rinna chu thiltih nei lovin amah chauhvin a awm chuan thi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ni, mi tuin emaw, “Nangin rinna i nei a, keiin thiltih ka nei a ni; i rinna chu i thiltih tel lovin mi entîr rawh; tin, keiin ka thiltihin ka rinna ka entîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian chu pakhat a ni tih i ring a ni maw? I tiṭha e; ramhuaite pawhin an ring a, an khûr ṭhîn asin,” a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw mi lawilopa, thiltih tel lova rinna mai chu eng mah a ni lo tih i hre duh em le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Min thlahtu Abrahama chuan a fapa Isaaka maichâm chunga a hlan lai khân, thiltih avângin thiam a chang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rinna chuan a thiltih nên a thawk dûn a; tin, thiltih avângin a rinna chu a famkim ta tih i hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian Lehkha Thu, “Abrahama chuan Pathian a ring a, chu rinna chu a felnaah ruat a ni,” tih thu kha a lo hlawhtling a; tichuan, Pathian ṭhianah vuahin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rinna avâng ngawt ni lovin, thiltih avâng zâwkin miin thiam a chang ṭhîn tih in hre ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin Rahabi nawhchizuar pawh khân enthlatute kha a lo lâwm a, kawng danga a hâwntîr lai khân thiltih avângin thiam a chang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thlarau tel lovin taksa chu thi a ni a, chutiang bawkin thiltih tel lovin rinna pawh chu thi a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka unaute u, in zînga mi tam tak hi zirtîrtuahte lo awm suh u, zirtîrtuin rorêlna nasa lehzual kan tâwk ang tih kan hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kan zain thil tam tak kan tisual fo ṭhîn. A thusawia tisual ngai lo mi chu mi puitling a ni a, a taksa pum pawh vêng thei mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai teh u, kan thu an âwih theih nân sakawr kaahte thîrbarh kan barh chuan, an taksa pum pawh kan kai her ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai teh u, lawngte pawh hi a lian hle a, thli na tak chhêm lênin a awm ṭhîn na a, a tihertu chuan a kaltîr duhna lam apiangah tihherna tê tak têin a tiher ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin lei pawh hi taksa pêng tê tak tê a ni a, nasa takin a uang ṭhîn. Ngai teh u, mei tê tak têin thing a va tikâng nasa êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, lei hi mei a ni; kan taksa pêngte zînga khawlohna hlâwm chu lei hi a ni; chu chuan taksa a pumin a tibawlhhlawh a, pianpui tawlailîr chu a tikâng a, amah chu hremhmun tihkan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sa chi tinrêng te, sava chi tinrêng te, rannung chi tinrêng te, tuifinriata mi chi tinrêng te hi khawi ngam theih an ni si a, mihringte khawi ngamin an awm bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />amaherawhchu, lei hi tu mahin an khawi ngam thei lo a ni; thihna hlova khat, sual awm hle hle thei lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu chuan Lalpa leh Pa kan fak ṭhîn a; chu vêk chuan Pathian anga siam mihringte chu ânchhia kan lawh bawk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka hmun khat aṭangin fakna leh ânchhe lawhna a chhuak ṭhîn. Ka unaute u, chûng thil chu chutiang tûr a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuikhur hian hna hmun khatah tui tui leh tui tui lo a tichhuak ṭhîn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka unaute u, theipui kûngah olive thei a rah thei em ni? A nih loh leh grêp hruiah theipui a rah thei em ni? Chutiang bawkin chi khur hian tui al lo a tichhuak thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In zîngah tu nge finga thu hre thei awm? Thuhnuairawlh tak leh fing takin a thiltihte chu awm dân ṭhatin entîr rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, in thinlungah îtsîkna nasa tak leh inelna in neih chuan, thu dik uan khum suh ula, thu dik dodâlin dâwt sawi hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chu finna chu chung lam aṭanga lo chhuk chu a ni lo va, khawvêl leh taksa châkna leh ramhuaia mi a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Inîtsîkna leh inelna awmnaah chuan buaina leh suahsualna tinrêng a awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chung lam aṭanga finna lo chhuak erawh chu a tîrin a thianghlim phawt a, chumi hnuah chuan inrem a duh a, a nunnêm a, a tih nuam a, zahngaihna leh rah ṭhain a khat a, thlei bîk a nei lo va, a vervêk lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Felna rah chu remna siamtute tân remnain tuh a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />In zînga indona leh inhnialnate hi khawi aṭanga lo chhuak nge ni? In taksa pêngahte indona siam ṭhîntu, in duh zâwng aṭangte chuan lo chhuak a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In châk a, in nei si lo va; tual in that a, in awt a, in nei thei si lo va: in inhnial a, in indo va; in dîl loh avângin in nei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In dîl a, in dîl dik loh avângin in hmu lo, in nawmsak nân hman in tum si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangni uirete u, khawvêl ṭhian nihna hi Pathian hmêlma nihna a ni tih in hre lo vem ni? Chutichuan, tu pawh khawvêl ṭhian nih duh apiang chu Pathian hmêlmaah a insiam ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nih loh leh, “Thlarau keimahnia a chêntîr chuan thîk khawp hialin min duh a ni,” tih hi, Pathian Lehkha Thuin eng mah lovin sawiin in ring em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, khawngaihna tam lehzual a pe ṭhîn; chuvângin, Pathian Lehkha Thuin, “Pathianin mi chapote a dodâl a, inngaitlâwmte erawh chu khawngaihna a pe ṭhîn,” a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pathian thû thûin awm rawh u; amaherawhchu, Diabola dodâl rawh u; tichuan, a tlân bosan ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian hnaih rawh u; tichuan, anin a hnaih ang che u. Mi sualte u, in kutte sil fai rawh u; rilru bulbâl nei lote u, in thinlung tithianghlim rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hrehawm ula, lungngai ula, ṭap rawh u; in nuih lungngaihah chang sela, in hlim nguiah chang rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa mit hmuhin inngaitlâwm rawh u; tichuan, a chawimawi ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Unaute u, insawi chhe tawn suh u. Tu pawhin a unau a sawichhiatin emaw, a unau a sawisêlin emaw, Dân a sawichhiain Dân a sawisêl a ni; nimahsela, Dân i sawisêl chuan Dân zâwmtu i ni lo va, rorêltu i ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dân petu leh rorêltu pakhat chauh a awm, chhandam theia tiboral theia chu. Nang ṭhenawmte sawisêltu chu tu nge maw i nih le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tûnah ngai teh u khai, nangni, “Vawiinah emaw, naktûkah emaw, chumi khawpuiah chuan kan kal ang a, chutah chuan kum khat kan va thang ang a, kan sumdâwng ang a, hlâwkna kan hmu ang,” titute u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />naktûkah chuan eng nge lo awm dâwn in hre si lo. In nunna chu eng nge ni? Chhûm rei lo tê lo langa, ral leh ta mai ṭhîn ang hi in ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, “Lalpan rem a tih chuan kan dam ang a, chumi khami kan ti ang,” in ti tûr hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, in uannate hi in chhuang zâwk si a, chutiang chhuanna zawng zawng chu sual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, tu pawh thil ṭha tih tûr hriaa ti si lo chu a tân sual a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi hausate u, ngai teh u khai! In chunga hrehawm lo thleng dâwn mêk avâng chuan ṭap ula, chiau vak vak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In rote a chhe ta a, in puante sûlrûlin a ei zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In rangkachak leh in tangkaruate a tuiêk zo ta; a tuiêk chu in thiam lohzia hriattîrna a ni ang a, in tisa chu mei kan angin a ei ang. Ni hnuhnûngah chuan ro in khâwl khâwm a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai teh u, in lova buh âta inhlawhfate hlawh, tihdera in pêk loh kha a au va, a âttute mangang au thâwm pawh chu Mipuite Lalpa bengah a lo lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khawvêlah hian nuamsa takin in awm a, in inkhawhral mai mai a; inthah niin in thinlung in titlai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi fel chu thiam loh in chantîr a, in that a; ani chuan a dodâl lo a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, unaute u, Lalpa lo kal hma loh zawng chhel takin awm rawh u. Ngai teh u, lo neitu chuan ruah tui tla hmasa leh hnuhnûng chu a hmuh hma loh chuan chhel takin lei rah hlu tak chu a nghâk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangni pawh chhel takin awm rawh u; in thinlung tinghet rawh u; Lalpa lo kalna chu a hnai tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Unaute u, thiam loh changa in awm loh nân inphun suh u; ngai teh u, Rorêltu chu kawngka bulah a ding reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Unaute u, Lalpa hminga thu sawitu zâwlneite chu, tuar dân leh chhel dân kawngah chuan entawn atân hmang rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai teh u, tuartute chu engthâwl kan ti a; Joba chhelzia chu in hria a, Lalpan a tâwpa a tihzia pawh kha in hmu bawk a, Lalpa chu khawngaihnain a khahzia leh zah a ngaih theihzia pawh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka unaute u, eng pawh ti mah ula, chhia chham suh u; vân chhâlin emaw, lei chhâlin emaw, thil dang rêng rêng chhâlin emaw chhia chham suh u; “Ni” in tih chu “Ni” ni sela, “Ni lo” in tih chu “Ni lo” ni rawh se; chuti lo chuan, thiam loh changin in awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In zîngah thil ṭha lo tuar an awm em? Ṭawngṭai rawh se. Hlim an awm em? Fakna hla sa rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In zîngah damlo an awm em? Kohhran upa kohtîr sela, anin Lalpa hminga hriak hnawihin a chungah ṭawngṭai rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tin, rinnaa ṭawngṭaina chuan damlo chu a chhandam ang a, Lalpa chuan ani chu a kai tho vang; tin, thil a lo tihsual tawh chuan ngaihdamsak a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, tihdama in awm theih nân in sualte thupha chawi tawn ula, inṭawngṭaisak tawn ṭhîn rawh u. Mi fel ṭawngṭaina chuan thil nasa tak a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Elija chu keimahni nungchang ang pu mihring bawk a ni a, ani chu ruah sûr loh nân ṭhahnemngai takin a ṭawngṭai a; tin, kum thum leh thla ruk chhûng zawng lei chungah ruah a sûr ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, a ṭawngṭai leh a, vânin ruah a sûrtîr a, leiin a rahte a rawn chhuahtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka unaute u, in zînga mi tu pawh thutak aṭang chuan bo sela; tin, tuin emaw hawi kîrtîr sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />mi sual a kawng bona ata hawi kîrtîrtu chuan thihna ata a thlarau a chhandam ang a, sual tam tak a khuhsak bawk ang tih inhre rawh se.
  </para>
</usx>
